Track 1: Seedling In The Gate
- Story & Context: Young Elias discovered an unlabeled film canister near the projection booth that tasted like ozone and dried copper. When he fed it into the machine, the screen didn't show images, but the projector began to hum a melody that turned the room's oxygen into a bitter, metallic smog. As the film melted, Elias realized he was not watching a movie, but the biography of his own future failures. "The sprocket teeth chew the morning light until the garden turns to ash."
